{"seq":3,"slug":"discrete","title":"离散与快速","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dft","title":"离散傅里叶变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete/dft","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"fft-algorithm","title":"FFT 快速算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete/fft-algorithm","wordCount":1450,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"sampling-aliasing","title":"采样与混叠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/fourier-analysis/discrete/sampling-aliasing","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"离散与快速\">离散与快速</h1><p>前两章的傅里叶世界是连续的、无限的——积分从负无穷到正无穷，频率取遍整条实轴。但计算机存不下连续函数，也算不了无穷积分。本章是傅里叶分析从黑板走向芯片的关键一跃：把信号离散化、有限化，得到一个纯线性代数对象——离散傅里叶变换（DFT），再用一个绝妙的分治算法（FFT）让它在工程上真正可用。</p>\n<p>三篇文档构成一条从「定义」到「能跑」到「别用错」的实战链条。第一篇「离散傅里叶变换」给出 DFT 的求和定义、它作为矩阵乘法的形式、以及它隐含的周期性假设——这个假设正是后面频谱泄漏问题的根源。第二篇「FFT 快速算法」讲清楚 Cooley-Tukey 分治如何把朴素 DFT 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 砍到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，以及为什么这个算法被 IEEE 评为二十世纪十大算法之一。第三篇「采样与混叠」回到连续与离散的接缝处，用奈奎斯特-香农采样定理回答「采样率多高才不丢信息」，并解释采样不足时混叠如何把高频伪装成低频。</p>\n<p>在 hub 中，本章是 <a href=\"../transforms/\">变换</a> 章的离散对应物：连续变换的每条性质几乎都有 DFT 版本，但离散化也引入了周期性、有限长这些连续世界没有的新麻烦，正是这些麻烦催生了下一章 <a href=\"../practice/\">实践</a> 里的窗函数与谱估计。</p>\n<p>前置需要会基本的复数运算与矩阵乘法；FFT 的复杂度分析涉及递归与分治思想。FFT 实现中的浮点误差累积属于数值方法范畴，本章只点到，系统讨论见 <a href=\"../../numerical-methods/\">数值方法 (06)</a>。建议严格按 DFT→FFT→采样的顺序读，三篇环环相扣。</p>\n"}